* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* NOMUX
*   Perform basic functions on a Unix / Windows node
*
* This little utility is started manually to check if the broker
* communication is alive.
*
* OPERATING SYSTEMS
*   UNIX, WNT, Windows2000
*
* Supported NPR Unix Functions:
*
* INFO, LOGIN, LOGOUT, APPEND, CLOSE, COPY, DELDIR, DELETE, DIR,
* GETATTR, MOVE, READ, SCAN, SCRE, SETATTR, WRITE, COMMAND
*
*
* MODIFICATIONS
* User Id yyyy-mm-dd Mark      Comment
* fhi     2001-01-24           Created
* fhi     2004-12-06 NOM3101   Make passwords case-sensitive
* fhi     2005-10-14   P(266530) Recompiled, XXUX---P changed.
* fhi     2007-03-26   FHI212  XXUX---P changed, XXUX---N rewritten
* fhi     2012-04-03 NOMALL-1119 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* fhi     2014-08-29 NOMALL-1454 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* SU      2017-10-09 NOM35       Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* BLI     2019-05-06 NOMALL-2261 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
LOCAL USING XXUX---P
LOCAL
1 A (A1)
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
SET KEY PF3
REPEAT
  SET CONTROL 'L'
  INPUT USING MAP 'NOMUXM1'
  IF *PF-KEY = 'PF3'
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
  CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P
  IF P-ERC = 0
    P-ERT := 'Command successfully executed.'
  END-IF
END-REPEAT
END
